WEBVTT

01:45.240 --> 01:45.840
Lingling!

01:59.160 --> 01:59.680
Looking for me?

02:03.200 --> 02:03.640
No.

02:05.360 --> 02:06.240
You followed me all this way.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.040
Escorting me to school?

02:08.840 --> 02:09.240
No.

02:10.120 --> 02:10.680
You miss school?

02:11.400 --> 02:12.240
Not a chance.

02:14.160 --> 02:14.960
Then why are you

02:14.960 --> 02:15.800
sneaking after me?

02:17.240 --> 02:17.720
I'm bored.

02:19.400 --> 02:21.079
Either you miss school,

02:21.400 --> 02:22.520
or you care about me

02:22.520 --> 02:23.640
and want to walk me here.

02:24.079 --> 02:24.720
Pick one.

02:25.920 --> 02:27.400
I'm going this way too.

02:29.360 --> 02:29.720
Fine.

02:30.400 --> 02:31.079
Good answer.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.160
Why did they run off?

02:45.480 --> 02:46.160
They're scared of you.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.200
Scared of me?

02:47.960 --> 02:49.200
You're the infamous

02:49.280 --> 02:50.600
school devil.

02:51.040 --> 02:52.200
Who wouldn't run

02:52.680 --> 02:53.640
when they see you?

02:55.360 --> 02:56.400
Looks like

02:56.960 --> 02:57.880
they're scared of you.

02:58.320 --> 03:00.880
These ought to be enough.

03:01.840 --> 03:04.280
Take them all.

03:07.760 --> 03:09.520
What are you doing? Stop it!

03:11.080 --> 03:12.800
Lei's hair is a mess.

03:12.920 --> 03:14.440
You went too far.

03:15.240 --> 03:16.200
So you can bully me,

03:16.880 --> 03:17.960
and I can't fight back?

03:19.040 --> 03:19.840
I won't tell the teacher

03:19.840 --> 03:20.800
what happened today.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.720
But you need to know

03:22.880 --> 03:24.000
I'm no pushover.

03:28.079 --> 03:29.280
Why would they be scared of me?

03:29.280 --> 03:30.120
It's definitely you.

03:30.480 --> 03:31.280
But if you went to

03:31.280 --> 03:32.240
school with me,

03:32.400 --> 03:33.200
no one would dare

03:33.200 --> 03:33.920
pick on me again.

03:36.680 --> 03:37.640
Did you play

03:38.040 --> 03:38.520
the sympathy card

03:38.520 --> 03:39.320
on me last night?

03:40.280 --> 03:40.680
I...

03:41.400 --> 03:42.840
Pity card?

03:42.880 --> 03:44.160
I was genuinely pitiful.

03:44.160 --> 03:45.040
Look, look.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.000
I had to get

03:46.000 --> 03:47.360
so much of my hair cut off.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.440
If Auntie hadn't fixed it,

03:49.960 --> 03:51.400
I couldn't have shown my face today.

03:53.000 --> 03:53.600
Give me your phone.

03:54.920 --> 03:55.400
Why?

03:55.920 --> 03:56.320
Give it.

04:06.240 --> 04:06.840
What's this?

04:07.480 --> 04:08.560
I installed an app.

04:12.080 --> 04:12.880
Whenever you need me,

04:13.160 --> 04:14.920
tap the back of your phone three times,

04:15.040 --> 04:16.240
and I'll get your location instantly.

04:19.279 --> 04:20.120
So high-tech?

04:25.520 --> 04:26.360
But what's the point?

04:26.960 --> 04:27.640
It's not like you can

04:27.640 --> 04:28.640
show up instantly.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.160
Hope you never have to use it.

04:31.520 --> 04:32.480
I hope so too.

04:33.480 --> 04:33.960
Gotta go.

04:39.600 --> 04:41.000
Thanks, bodyguard.

04:46.880 --> 04:47.880
Bodyguard?

04:52.200 --> 04:53.159
It's done.

04:57.040 --> 04:58.159
My eyebrows!

05:02.560 --> 05:03.760
What did you do?

05:04.520 --> 05:05.120
Xiaolian,

05:05.400 --> 05:06.880
this is how eyebrow tattooing works.

05:07.280 --> 05:07.880
Look,

05:08.040 --> 05:09.320
I use this tool to

05:09.640 --> 05:11.120
make tiny cuts in the skin.

05:11.400 --> 05:12.080
It causes the blood

05:12.080 --> 05:13.560
to pool underneath,

05:13.920 --> 05:15.040
resulting in those two

05:15.240 --> 05:15.880
dark lines.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.280
Then they scab over,

05:17.800 --> 05:18.800
and the scabs will fall off.

05:19.080 --> 05:19.760
This process

05:19.760 --> 05:20.720
takes time.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.800
Once the scabs are gone, it'll be fine.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.240
Liar!

05:24.480 --> 05:25.600
You ruined my eyebrows!

05:25.880 --> 05:27.240
After my divorce from Zhu Feng,

05:27.240 --> 05:28.520
I finally got myself back on my feet.

05:28.840 --> 05:30.480
I was gonna have a blind date.

05:32.159 --> 05:34.080
How am I supposed to show my face like this?

05:34.080 --> 05:35.800
Xiaolian, I really didn't lie to you .

05:35.840 --> 05:36.760
I was just following

05:36.760 --> 05:37.840
the online tutorial.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.920
Besides, I'm a beginner,

05:39.960 --> 05:42.120
and I only charged you for the kit.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.240
You knew that.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.360
I don't care.

05:45.480 --> 05:46.600
You need to make this right today.

05:47.120 --> 05:47.560
Sure.

05:47.800 --> 05:49.000
I will fix it.

05:49.360 --> 05:50.000
First,

05:50.440 --> 05:51.600
I'm not charging you anything.

05:52.159 --> 05:52.640
Second,

05:53.040 --> 05:54.280
put some ointment on it,

05:54.840 --> 05:55.720
give it two days

05:55.720 --> 05:56.720
and see if it gets better.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.680
Keep it clean.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.560
Oh wait,

05:59.159 --> 06:00.040
one more thing.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.040
These are designer sunglasses

06:02.120 --> 06:03.080
my niece brought

06:03.120 --> 06:04.240
back from abroad. They're chic.

06:04.760 --> 06:05.440
Try them on.

06:08.200 --> 06:08.880
So stunning.

06:09.480 --> 06:10.120
Alright then.

06:10.440 --> 06:11.000
I'll

06:11.880 --> 06:12.640
trust you one more time.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.840
Okay. Just trust me.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.240
Take care.

06:17.880 --> 06:18.320
Lanfang,

06:19.080 --> 06:20.840
shall we tell Wu about this?

06:21.560 --> 06:22.280
Tell him what?

06:22.880 --> 06:23.560
If he finds out, I'm

06:24.280 --> 06:24.800
done for.

06:25.680 --> 06:26.320
Han,

06:26.760 --> 06:27.520
someone's here to see you.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.600
I was just looking for you.

06:28.920 --> 06:30.440
The project schedule needs revision.

06:30.680 --> 06:32.120
Several more storms are coming this month.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.760
Phase 3 is definitely going to be delayed.

06:34.440 --> 06:34.960
Also,

06:35.120 --> 06:36.440
remind everyone to stay safe on site

06:36.600 --> 06:37.320
and step up precautions.

06:37.800 --> 06:38.480
Got it.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.040
Go ahead.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.720
Dressed like that,

06:47.000 --> 06:47.960
are you here for business

06:48.000 --> 06:48.840
or a fight?

06:52.040 --> 06:52.960
Someone's bound to

06:52.960 --> 06:54.080
show up in a suit and tie.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.400
You know I don't

06:55.880 --> 06:56.720
dress to impress.

06:57.400 --> 06:58.720
Someone is

06:58.800 --> 07:00.280
good at putting on a show.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.120
You have to work

07:02.840 --> 07:03.760
hard to beat him.

07:09.240 --> 07:09.800
Boss,

07:10.320 --> 07:11.000
Xing Wu's here.

07:11.600 --> 07:12.080
Let him in.

07:15.360 --> 07:15.840
Go on.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.040
Good luck.

07:28.120 --> 07:28.720
Mr. Ye.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.160
Here you are. Sit.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.240
Let me introduce you.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.280
This is Yang Gang.

07:36.640 --> 07:37.159
Mr. Ye,

07:37.720 --> 07:38.400
we know each other.

07:38.760 --> 07:39.520
We go way back.

07:40.240 --> 07:41.040
Mr. Yang's quite

07:41.040 --> 07:41.960
famous in the industry.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.120
Old acquaintances.

07:45.360 --> 07:45.840
Have some tea.

07:46.120 --> 07:46.640
Thanks.

07:46.760 --> 07:47.920
We agreed to meet

07:48.159 --> 07:49.159
at 9:00 AM,

07:49.600 --> 07:50.720
but Mr. Yang

07:50.720 --> 07:51.960
showed up well before 9:00 AM.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.680
I owe you an apology.

08:00.880 --> 08:02.480
There was a family emergency days ago.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.080
So I missed our meeting.

08:04.680 --> 08:05.240
That was on me.

08:06.000 --> 08:06.800
Sit, sit.

08:06.920 --> 08:07.520
Have a seat.

08:08.640 --> 08:10.000
I value talent, and I like

08:10.640 --> 08:11.760
giving young people a chance.

08:12.760 --> 08:13.560
I'm looking for someone

08:13.600 --> 08:14.360
to take over the tech street

08:15.040 --> 08:15.840
and I need to

08:16.640 --> 08:17.680
choose between you two.

08:21.120 --> 08:21.600
Director.

08:21.920 --> 08:22.400
Feng,

08:22.640 --> 08:23.360
- You wanted to see me?
- Come over.

08:23.680 --> 08:25.480
That student of yours, Xing Wu, has taken

08:25.480 --> 08:27.680
a leave of absence for almost two years.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.560
Is he coming back?

08:29.280 --> 08:31.160
Of course. He's my student.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.760
You need to get on this.

08:32.960 --> 08:34.320
If he's not back within half a month,

08:34.480 --> 08:36.240
the school has to cancel his enrollment.

08:36.480 --> 08:36.880
Okay.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.240
I'm on it right away. Don't worry.

08:38.559 --> 08:39.360
Hurry up.

08:45.000 --> 08:45.360
Let's go.

08:50.320 --> 08:50.880
Ye.

08:51.280 --> 08:51.800
I need to ask you something.

08:54.080 --> 08:56.480
How has Wu been lately?

08:57.400 --> 08:58.440
He's busy making money.

08:59.520 --> 09:00.720
He picks up Ye from

09:00.720 --> 09:01.760
school when he has time.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.240
I wasn't asking you.

09:03.480 --> 09:03.880
Okay.

09:04.680 --> 09:05.480
So he's settled into

09:05.480 --> 09:06.680
life outside school.

09:09.320 --> 09:09.720
You are

09:09.720 --> 09:10.800
close to him.

09:11.240 --> 09:11.880
Talk to him for me.

09:11.880 --> 09:13.040
Tell him to come back to school soon.

09:13.240 --> 09:14.280
If he doesn't come back

09:14.320 --> 09:14.960
within half a month,

09:15.160 --> 09:16.360
his enrollment gets cancelled.

09:19.040 --> 09:19.480
Okay.

09:27.720 --> 09:28.840
You're

09:29.080 --> 09:29.920
quite something.

09:34.120 --> 09:36.000
Are you screwing

09:36.880 --> 09:37.960
Mr. Ye's secretary?

09:39.600 --> 09:40.240
Watch

09:40.680 --> 09:41.240
your mouth.

09:42.160 --> 09:43.240
You think Mr. Ye doesn't

09:43.680 --> 09:44.840
know about your dirty business?

09:45.840 --> 09:46.600
Keep it down.

09:47.720 --> 09:49.240
He hasn't decided yet.

09:49.920 --> 09:51.400
Me and my crew could

09:51.720 --> 09:52.640
easily take control

09:52.640 --> 09:53.520
of tech street.

09:59.680 --> 10:00.760
You think you can beat me just

10:01.840 --> 10:02.800
because you've got a crew?

10:05.360 --> 10:06.240
We'll see.

10:10.440 --> 10:11.320
What were you talking about?

10:11.560 --> 10:12.240
You stood so close.

10:12.800 --> 10:13.360
I was seeing him out.

10:13.840 --> 10:14.440
Mr. Ye wants to

10:14.440 --> 10:15.520
have a word with you alone.

10:16.680 --> 10:18.240
So I have a shot?

10:18.320 --> 10:19.680
A very good shot.

10:20.280 --> 10:21.600
This is the letter of intent.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.280
Look through the terms,

10:23.440 --> 10:24.760
and if you have any issues,

10:24.760 --> 10:26.000
just bring them up next time.

10:26.880 --> 10:27.240
Okay.

10:28.720 --> 10:29.640
Tell me,

10:30.120 --> 10:31.400
did you know all along

10:31.400 --> 10:32.360
Mr. Ye was going to pick you?

10:32.880 --> 10:33.480
Pretty much.

10:33.680 --> 10:34.520
That confident, huh?

10:35.240 --> 10:36.360
Mr. Ye must know

10:36.400 --> 10:37.560
all the shady things Yang Gang's done.

10:38.040 --> 10:38.680
He's looking for

10:38.680 --> 10:39.880
someone to run the business,

10:40.240 --> 10:41.120
not someone who'll

10:41.160 --> 10:42.360
drain his resources and pocket kickbacks.

10:46.320 --> 10:47.360
I just realized

10:47.440 --> 10:48.760
you think like a real boss.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.360
You'd make a good one.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.840
Let's go. Lunch's on me.

10:56.920 --> 10:57.480
Thanks.

11:00.400 --> 11:00.920
Let me mix it for you.

11:01.280 --> 11:02.240
Thanks. I can do it myself.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.120
You don't get it.

11:03.160 --> 11:04.600
There's an art to it.

11:05.000 --> 11:05.520
Look,

11:05.920 --> 11:06.920
mix in the toppings first,

11:08.560 --> 11:09.240
then the sauce.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.800
It tastes better this way.

11:11.880 --> 11:13.280
I don't need all the fuss.

11:31.880 --> 11:32.800
Mix the rest yourself.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.200
Okay.

11:36.920 --> 11:38.640
What's up? What's so urgent?

11:40.880 --> 11:41.520
Han.

11:42.720 --> 11:43.480
Nothing.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.960
It's fine. Just say it.

11:52.720 --> 11:53.720
Han's not an outsider.

11:57.640 --> 11:58.280
You must be hungry.

11:58.640 --> 11:59.680
Let me get you a bowl of noodles.

12:00.360 --> 12:01.000
You want some soup?

12:01.680 --> 12:02.080
Okay.

12:07.040 --> 12:07.960
Mr. Zhu said

12:08.280 --> 12:09.040
if you're not back

12:09.040 --> 12:10.360
at school within half a month,

12:10.840 --> 12:12.240
they'll take you off the school roll.

12:19.120 --> 12:19.880
That's it?

12:22.480 --> 12:23.800
What do you mean "that's it"?

12:24.960 --> 12:26.320
This is huge.

12:34.720 --> 12:35.160
Ye,

12:35.520 --> 12:36.440
I knew you were coming.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.520
They make the best

12:37.560 --> 12:39.240
Beijing zhajiang noodles around here.

12:39.720 --> 12:40.320
Have a try.

12:40.440 --> 12:41.440
See how they compare to

12:41.480 --> 12:42.440
what you had back home.

12:45.720 --> 12:46.280
Han,

12:47.120 --> 12:48.560
Wu told me

12:48.840 --> 12:50.400
you went to university in Beijing.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.400
With your abilities,

12:52.680 --> 12:53.920
why didn't you stay?

12:54.080 --> 12:55.040
Why come back?

12:55.400 --> 12:56.480
In my final year,

12:57.360 --> 12:58.880
commuting between school and my internship

12:59.160 --> 13:00.440
took over four hours a day.

13:00.720 --> 13:01.600
The morning rush

13:01.680 --> 13:02.760
was unbearable.

13:03.240 --> 13:03.880
So suffocating.

13:04.040 --> 13:04.640
That just wasn't

13:04.640 --> 13:05.480
the life I wanted.

13:06.520 --> 13:07.240
So

13:08.040 --> 13:10.040
you came back

13:10.040 --> 13:11.600
to live the life

13:12.000 --> 13:13.040
you wanted?

13:13.480 --> 13:14.480
It's like

13:14.880 --> 13:16.120
Beijing seafood,

13:16.480 --> 13:17.560
no matter how good,

13:17.640 --> 13:19.000
can never beat the fresh catch back home.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.000
And the noodles here,

13:21.240 --> 13:22.320
no matter how authentic,

13:22.720 --> 13:23.640
can't compare to the real thing in Beijing.

13:24.920 --> 13:25.400
Right?

13:27.720 --> 13:28.680
Enough about me. Ye,

13:29.120 --> 13:30.680
do you still plan to go abroad?

13:32.400 --> 13:34.160
It's not an option now.

13:34.920 --> 13:35.840
But I still want to

13:35.840 --> 13:36.760
go see the world someday.

13:38.560 --> 13:40.320
The world isn't just up in the skyscrapers.

13:41.040 --> 13:43.880
It's down in the streets too.

13:46.240 --> 13:46.920
You're right.

13:47.760 --> 13:48.320
One

13:49.120 --> 13:50.680
has to experience more

13:51.520 --> 13:52.520
before he knows

13:52.520 --> 13:53.560
what he truly wants.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.920
What I want is

13:56.640 --> 13:57.240
work,

13:57.960 --> 13:58.440
family,

13:58.800 --> 14:00.360
everything I love close by.

14:01.000 --> 14:01.680
Simple but happy.

14:02.040 --> 14:02.600
That's enough.

14:03.920 --> 14:04.440
Wu,

14:04.960 --> 14:05.760
am I right?

14:09.640 --> 14:10.160
Is that so?

14:14.680 --> 14:15.840
All I know is

14:16.800 --> 14:18.080
I wanna stay at Zhazhating

14:18.480 --> 14:19.680
and live my life.

14:21.400 --> 14:22.600
I'll follow up

14:22.640 --> 14:23.880
with Mr. Ye.

14:24.160 --> 14:25.440
Then you can get the contract

14:25.440 --> 14:26.000
signed.

14:26.280 --> 14:27.240
Once it's signed,

14:27.480 --> 14:28.360
I'll treat you again.

14:29.480 --> 14:31.120
Let's go somewhere nice then.

14:33.520 --> 14:34.560
Once the deal is secure,

14:35.680 --> 14:37.080
you're really not going back

14:37.120 --> 14:37.920
to school?

14:39.640 --> 14:40.600
Are you going back to school?

14:44.240 --> 14:45.080
More importantly,

14:45.680 --> 14:46.600
the noodles are

14:46.600 --> 14:47.360
getting mushy.

14:47.880 --> 14:48.520
Just eat.

15:07.400 --> 15:08.480
[Mission failed.]

15:26.360 --> 15:28.240
It's going to be a tough battle.

15:30.960 --> 15:31.640
Mr. Zhu?

15:34.320 --> 15:35.520
Perfect timing.

15:36.320 --> 15:36.680
Let's go.

15:38.160 --> 15:39.080
We're one short.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.720
Come on, Mr. Zhu.

15:40.760 --> 15:41.240
Let's start.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.240
Mrs. Xing,

15:45.680 --> 15:47.000
I came to talk about

15:47.000 --> 15:48.440
Xing Wu going back to school.

15:48.480 --> 15:49.680
We shouldn't discuss

15:49.880 --> 15:50.560
something

15:50.600 --> 15:51.760
this serious over a mahjong table,

15:51.760 --> 15:52.480
right?

15:53.240 --> 15:54.760
Mr. Zhu,

15:54.800 --> 15:56.240
that's where you're wrong.

15:57.080 --> 15:58.680
In Zhazhating, everything can be

15:58.800 --> 15:59.600
talked over a mahjong table.

16:00.040 --> 16:01.400
Weddings, funerals,

16:01.640 --> 16:02.720
favors, business,

16:03.080 --> 16:04.160
and even

16:04.320 --> 16:05.040
the seafood prices.

16:05.320 --> 16:06.040
South Wind.

16:07.000 --> 16:07.960
Let's be clear.

16:08.080 --> 16:09.600
We just play for fun.

16:09.840 --> 16:10.440
No gambling.

16:10.520 --> 16:11.240
Of course.

16:11.400 --> 16:11.840
Eight Characters.

16:12.240 --> 16:12.600
Pung.

16:18.560 --> 16:19.240
Mr. Zhu,

16:19.440 --> 16:20.440
do you know why

16:20.440 --> 16:21.480
I prefer mahjong

16:21.480 --> 16:22.520
over poker?

16:22.720 --> 16:23.320
Why?

16:25.400 --> 16:26.840
Take palm reading

16:26.840 --> 16:27.920
for example.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.280
Two hands represent

16:29.280 --> 16:30.320
different things.

16:30.440 --> 16:32.000
The left one, fate,

16:32.240 --> 16:33.680
The right one, luck.

16:34.080 --> 16:35.240
In poker,

16:35.240 --> 16:36.440
players draw

16:36.640 --> 16:37.880
until the deck runs out.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.480
Whatever card you're dealt

16:39.560 --> 16:40.760
is fated.

16:41.160 --> 16:43.040
But mahjong is different.

16:43.400 --> 16:44.400
Your hand

16:44.480 --> 16:46.680
keeps changing.

16:47.560 --> 16:48.680
Luck can change your fate.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.880
Even with one tile left,

16:51.960 --> 16:53.120
you can still

16:53.160 --> 16:54.360
win big.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.160
Right.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.480
No matter how bad

16:57.480 --> 16:58.280
your hand is,

16:58.360 --> 16:59.920
as long as there's a chance,

17:00.000 --> 17:01.280
you still haven't lost.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.560
If this tile isn't what you want,

17:03.680 --> 17:04.680
draw the next.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.359
If you don't win this round,

17:06.560 --> 17:07.680
there's always a next.

17:09.119 --> 17:10.680
Good point, Mrs. Fan.

17:11.240 --> 17:12.359
By that logic,

17:12.480 --> 17:13.480
Xing Wu

17:13.560 --> 17:15.359
turning me down is just round one.

17:15.520 --> 17:17.160
No matter how many times he says no,

17:17.520 --> 17:18.839
I won't stop

17:18.960 --> 17:20.319
until I succeed.

17:20.599 --> 17:21.280
That's it.

17:22.280 --> 17:22.760
Eight Circles.

17:23.280 --> 17:23.760
I win.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.440
Me too.

17:25.480 --> 17:26.520
And me.

17:27.000 --> 17:28.720
One tile, three winners.

17:28.960 --> 17:29.720
Mr. Zhu,

17:30.520 --> 17:31.440
how's that?

17:42.640 --> 17:43.120
Xing Wu!

17:45.440 --> 17:46.000
Mr. Zhu,

17:46.840 --> 17:48.040
why did you come out of the mahjong parlor?

17:49.720 --> 17:51.080
I came for a home visit.

17:51.680 --> 17:53.000
Your mom, Fan Tong's mom,

17:53.240 --> 17:54.320
and Kyle's mom

17:54.320 --> 17:54.880
dragged me there

17:54.880 --> 17:55.760
and destroyed me.

17:56.520 --> 17:57.880
Mission failed again.

17:58.120 --> 17:59.400
Yeah, bad luck.

17:59.520 --> 18:00.280
So

18:00.520 --> 18:01.760
why did you all this way

18:01.880 --> 18:02.640
and waste your time?

18:04.760 --> 18:05.360
Wu,

18:06.400 --> 18:07.800
if even just one word

18:08.120 --> 18:09.720
of mine gets through to you,

18:09.720 --> 18:11.240
I didn't come for nothing.

18:11.880 --> 18:12.520
Yeah, right.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.000
There are yours.

18:16.560 --> 18:17.120
What's this?

18:28.760 --> 18:30.360
I've kept them long enough.

18:30.600 --> 18:32.120
Time to give them to you.

18:34.240 --> 18:35.480
Useless things should be thrown away.

18:36.320 --> 18:36.880
Mr. Zhu,

18:37.520 --> 18:38.080
take my advice.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.160
You should move on.

18:40.840 --> 18:41.480
Don't cling to the past.

18:46.400 --> 18:48.520
Whether you throw them away or not

18:49.160 --> 18:50.040
is up to you,

18:50.840 --> 18:51.880
once you figure everything out.

19:12.560 --> 19:13.240
Drink this.

19:14.960 --> 19:15.720
Listen,

19:16.280 --> 19:17.600
Mr. Zhu came

19:18.280 --> 19:19.240
by today.

19:19.480 --> 19:20.960
We played mahjong together.

19:23.680 --> 19:24.680
But he kept going on about

19:24.680 --> 19:25.680
you going back to school,

19:26.440 --> 19:28.080
and he kept losing.

19:28.240 --> 19:30.280
I had the upper hand the whole game.

19:30.600 --> 19:31.440
Haven't had that much fun

19:31.440 --> 19:32.400
in ages.

19:35.720 --> 19:36.760
What do you think about

19:37.640 --> 19:38.240
me going back to school?

19:40.360 --> 19:42.880
It's definitely a good thing.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.280
Go back if you can.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.480
Don't worry about us.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.720
I've got things covered.

19:48.960 --> 19:49.960
None of that matters.

19:50.720 --> 19:51.680
What matters

19:52.320 --> 19:53.120
is that you

19:53.120 --> 19:54.240
take your time

19:54.680 --> 19:55.880
and think it through.

20:45.480 --> 20:46.760
[ID photos should have a blue background.]

20:46.760 --> 20:47.680
Can we take it here?

20:48.080 --> 20:49.120
What's the problem?

20:49.240 --> 20:50.760
The sea is blue, the sky is blue.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.760
It's all blue.

20:52.160 --> 20:52.880
Quick, turn around.

20:53.480 --> 20:56.240
Three, two, one.

20:56.320 --> 20:57.000
Wu, smile.

20:57.080 --> 20:57.560
Cheese.

20:57.960 --> 20:58.720
You're up.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.360
I'm next! I'm next!

20:59.360 --> 20:59.720
You take it.

20:59.720 --> 21:00.160
It's my turn.

21:01.920 --> 21:03.360
Three, two, one.

21:03.920 --> 21:04.560
Alright, done.

21:04.560 --> 21:05.440
My turn. My turn.

21:50.760 --> 21:52.120
Mom, what's up?

21:53.120 --> 21:53.760
It's me.

21:53.840 --> 21:54.800
Can I come in?

21:57.760 --> 21:58.160
Yes.

22:01.760 --> 22:02.160
What's wrong?

22:03.280 --> 22:04.680
The zipper on my uniform is broken.

22:04.800 --> 22:05.640
Do you have any pliers?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.520
I want to fix it.

22:07.280 --> 22:07.720
Give it to me.

22:15.040 --> 22:15.600
What are these?

22:16.840 --> 22:17.360
Nothing.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.440
Let me see. Let me see.

22:19.280 --> 22:20.720
Mr. Zhu gave you these today, right?

22:22.520 --> 22:23.280
There's nothing to see.

22:24.120 --> 22:25.760
You've won so many awards.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.400
Paper plane?

22:28.080 --> 22:28.880
That's

22:30.120 --> 22:32.320
a drone obstacle course competition?

22:33.680 --> 22:34.960
You even won at basketball.

22:34.960 --> 22:36.560
And prize money. Not bad.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.080
That's all in the past.

22:38.960 --> 22:39.640
Not worth mentioning.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.440
I fixed your zipper.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.520
Try it.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.640
You try it on.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.520
I've never seen you

22:56.520 --> 22:58.000
in your school uniform.

22:59.800 --> 23:00.600
Let me see

23:01.240 --> 23:01.800
if you still look

23:01.800 --> 23:02.960
like a student.

23:04.960 --> 23:05.360
Here.

23:29.720 --> 23:30.600
It's a bit small.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.320
You look the part.

23:52.440 --> 23:53.640
[You told me once]

23:54.400 --> 23:55.720
[that paper planes always]

23:56.080 --> 23:56.800
[come down.]

23:57.840 --> 23:59.240
[But I found a way]

23:59.960 --> 24:01.680
[to keep it from falling.]

24:54.440 --> 24:54.840
Look.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.360
Even a paper plane can

24:57.360 --> 24:58.720
find a new way to stay in the air.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.240
Don't you want to change your mind?

25:43.520 --> 25:44.880
[Meeting with Mr. Ye]

25:45.120 --> 25:46.560
[at the office, at 9:00 AM on the 29th.]

25:56.080 --> 26:00.720
I'm gonna make it!

26:27.240 --> 26:28.640
[I'll take you somewhere tomorrow.]

26:39.840 --> 26:41.400
Did I

26:42.280 --> 26:43.480
get through to him?

26:46.160 --> 26:46.680
[Okay.]

27:08.400 --> 27:09.360
Where are you taking me?

27:10.240 --> 27:11.320
Somewhere good.

27:12.800 --> 27:13.560
Somewhere good?

27:13.960 --> 27:15.320
You'd better not disappoint me.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.120
Let's go!

27:28.480 --> 27:29.520
Li Lanfang,

27:29.880 --> 27:30.880
get out here!

27:31.000 --> 27:31.520
Coming.

27:34.640 --> 27:35.120
Xiaolian,

27:35.240 --> 27:37.320
why are you so angry?

27:39.000 --> 27:39.600
Look!

27:39.800 --> 27:40.760
It's been days

27:40.960 --> 27:42.000
and the scabs aren't falling off.

27:42.120 --> 27:43.160
Now my face is breaking out!

27:43.880 --> 27:44.480
Xiaolian,

27:45.120 --> 27:46.480
your face and your eyebrows...

27:46.800 --> 27:47.160
This...

27:47.400 --> 27:47.880
Wait,

27:48.080 --> 27:49.000
The rash can't be

27:49.000 --> 27:50.320
caused by the eyebrow treatment.

27:50.560 --> 27:51.360
Did you put something

27:51.360 --> 27:51.920
on your face?

27:51.960 --> 27:52.960
Don't try to

27:52.960 --> 27:53.760
shift the blame.

27:54.080 --> 27:54.760
You need to take

27:54.760 --> 27:55.920
responsibility for what you did.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.600
Xiaolian,

27:58.240 --> 27:59.000
what happened?

27:59.120 --> 28:00.400
Get her some water. Help her calm down.

28:00.480 --> 28:02.000
Right, right. Calm down.

28:02.080 --> 28:03.440
Calm down?

28:03.560 --> 28:04.360
Ma'am,

28:04.600 --> 28:05.440
do you even know

28:05.640 --> 28:06.600
eyebrow tattooing

28:06.600 --> 28:07.520
needs licenses?

28:07.800 --> 28:09.080
I bet she doesn't have one.

28:09.440 --> 28:11.160
I nearly got conned!

28:11.280 --> 28:12.040
Now

28:12.240 --> 28:13.560
you owe me for my ruined brows

28:13.720 --> 28:15.240
and for emotional distress.

28:15.320 --> 28:16.280
I'll pay. I'll pay.

28:16.480 --> 28:17.320
Just calm down first.

28:17.560 --> 28:18.560
We can talk

28:18.560 --> 28:19.600
this through.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.560
Tell me what you want,

28:20.600 --> 28:21.400
and I'll make it right.

28:21.480 --> 28:23.240
It's not a big deal, right?

28:23.720 --> 28:24.960
Not a big deal?

28:25.120 --> 28:26.280
If your face looked like mine,

28:26.280 --> 28:27.400
you'd still think it was no big deal?

28:27.560 --> 28:28.320
Listen up,

28:28.360 --> 28:29.320
I'm reporting you

28:29.360 --> 28:30.240
and shutting this place down.

28:30.360 --> 28:32.040
I'll make sure you lose everything, Li Lanfang!

28:32.120 --> 28:33.240
Smash the place!

28:34.720 --> 28:35.840
Don't do this!

28:35.920 --> 28:38.080
Stop it! Stop!

28:38.320 --> 28:39.840
Stop it, Xiaolian!

28:40.080 --> 28:42.120
Don't! Stop!

28:42.320 --> 28:43.720
Don't, Xiaolian!

28:43.720 --> 28:45.000
No! Please stop!

28:48.040 --> 28:48.600
Mom!

28:49.120 --> 28:49.680
Grandma!

28:51.840 --> 28:52.280
Mom!

28:52.440 --> 28:52.960
Grandma!

28:53.440 --> 28:54.160
Lanfang...

28:54.880 --> 28:56.760
Mom, where are you hurt? Mom?

28:57.040 --> 28:57.920
My legs.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.080
My legs.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.000
- Mom?
- My legs.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.960
Li Lanfang, listen,

29:04.240 --> 29:05.680
compensate me for my eyebrows,

29:06.000 --> 29:07.040
or I'm coming back.

29:08.040 --> 29:09.600
What's wrong with that old lady?

29:09.640 --> 29:10.280
Stop right there!

29:10.640 --> 29:11.640
What do you think you're doing?

29:12.280 --> 29:13.320
Causing trouble on our turf,

29:13.320 --> 29:14.240
you got a death wish?

29:14.240 --> 29:15.000
Who are you?

29:15.000 --> 29:15.680
Y-You...

29:16.080 --> 29:17.080
Hey, what are you doing?

29:17.200 --> 29:17.720
You...

29:18.240 --> 29:18.880
Y-You...

29:18.960 --> 29:19.680
Don't you dare walk away.

29:23.160 --> 29:24.840
his place is beautiful.

29:25.600 --> 29:26.800
I've been in Zhazhating so long

29:26.800 --> 29:27.640
and never found it.

29:28.240 --> 29:28.960
This is my secret hideout

29:28.960 --> 29:29.720
as a kid.

29:30.560 --> 29:31.720
Every year from May to September,

29:32.080 --> 29:33.120
southeast winds blew,

29:33.600 --> 29:35.280
I'd come here to test my planes.

29:35.680 --> 29:36.680
Those four months

29:37.040 --> 29:38.560
were the best part of every year for me.

29:41.960 --> 29:42.800
Why

29:43.800 --> 29:44.640
did that ship

29:45.160 --> 29:46.240
run aground?

29:47.080 --> 29:47.760
There was

29:47.760 --> 29:48.720
a sudden storm.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.520
The crew panicked

29:51.520 --> 29:52.320
and made mistakes.

29:53.280 --> 29:54.760
The ship's been stranded there ever since.

29:57.800 --> 29:58.560
People

29:59.240 --> 30:00.520
say it's a failed ship

30:01.560 --> 30:02.760
because it never

30:03.000 --> 30:04.240
made it to the destination.

30:16.720 --> 30:17.240
Have a try.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.120
My mom told me that

30:31.000 --> 30:32.640
people are happiest

30:33.000 --> 30:34.240
when they're full of hope.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.520
Even happier than when their dreams

30:36.520 --> 30:37.160
come true.

30:40.120 --> 30:40.640
That's true.

30:41.960 --> 30:42.880
But I haven't

30:43.840 --> 30:44.600
hoped for anything

30:44.600 --> 30:45.440
in a long time.

30:50.640 --> 30:51.240
Yeah,

30:52.040 --> 30:53.320
that ship ran aground.

30:54.760 --> 30:55.960
The storm stopped

30:55.960 --> 30:56.840
its journey,

30:58.720 --> 30:59.600
but the wind

31:00.640 --> 31:02.000
carries its unfinished story

31:02.000 --> 31:02.760
forward.

31:08.520 --> 31:09.200
Wu,

31:11.680 --> 31:12.920
if you're willing to come back,

31:15.240 --> 31:16.160
you'll always be welcome.

31:37.760 --> 31:38.240
Hello?

31:38.640 --> 31:39.280
[Wu,]

31:39.680 --> 31:40.560
[something happened to Grandma!]

31:46.040 --> 31:47.520
There we go.

31:47.600 --> 31:49.040
Almost done.

31:50.040 --> 31:50.560
Bear with it.

31:54.800 --> 31:55.360
There. All done.

31:55.360 --> 31:57.760
Most likely an ankle fracture.

31:58.240 --> 31:58.840
She'll need an X-ray.

31:59.240 --> 31:59.880
This time,

32:00.160 --> 32:01.440
you need to take her to a 3A hospital.

32:02.240 --> 32:02.920
No, no.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.800
Don't take me to some big hospital.

32:05.040 --> 32:06.120
Lanfang, Wu,

32:06.360 --> 32:07.320
my legs have

32:07.320 --> 32:08.600
been paralyzed for years.

32:08.640 --> 32:09.520
I can't feel a thing.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.400
It doesn't hurt.

32:10.560 --> 32:11.440
Don't listen to him.

32:11.680 --> 32:13.000
I'm not going to hospital.

32:14.280 --> 32:15.560
All right, ma'am.

32:15.960 --> 32:17.240
Stop toughing it out.

32:18.080 --> 32:19.240
If it gets serious...

32:19.280 --> 32:19.920
Hello, Han?

32:20.520 --> 32:21.560
Something urgent came up.

32:21.920 --> 32:22.880
Could I borrow your car?

32:25.080 --> 32:26.560
Mr. Ye, sorry to trouble you this late.

32:26.920 --> 32:27.840
Thank you for arranging

32:27.880 --> 32:28.880
the examination and surgery.

32:30.280 --> 32:31.280
The surgery is underway now.

32:31.520 --> 32:32.240
Dr. Liu, the top orthopedic

32:32.240 --> 32:33.160
surgeon, is operating.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.480
When you have time,

32:35.520 --> 32:35.960
Xing Wu and I

32:35.960 --> 32:37.280
would like to thank you in person.

32:37.880 --> 32:38.560
Thank you so much.

32:38.600 --> 32:39.280
We really appreciate it.

32:40.160 --> 32:40.800
Okay. Okay.

32:44.640 --> 32:45.480
Sorry to trouble you.

32:46.360 --> 32:46.840
Thank you.

32:47.240 --> 32:47.640
It's fine.

32:48.920 --> 32:50.360
Why did I ever learn

32:50.360 --> 32:52.160
eyebrow tattooing online?

32:52.760 --> 32:53.600
Otherwise,

32:53.600 --> 32:55.120
none of this would've happened

32:55.560 --> 32:56.240
What were

32:56.480 --> 32:57.040
you thinking?

32:57.640 --> 32:58.440
Offering uncertified eyebrow tattooing?

32:59.920 --> 33:03.040
I just wanted to make more money.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.080
Auntie,

33:04.480 --> 33:06.440
eyebrow tattooing is a minor procedure.

33:07.000 --> 33:08.720
You need five kinds of licenses.

33:08.920 --> 33:10.440
You can't just do it on people.

33:11.120 --> 33:11.920
Five?

33:22.760 --> 33:23.200
Dr. Liu?

33:23.240 --> 33:23.960
The surgery went well.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.480
Keep a close eye

33:27.520 --> 33:28.240
on swelling

33:28.240 --> 33:29.400
and circulation in the ankle.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.080
If you notice anything,

33:31.360 --> 33:32.240
get a nurse right away.

33:32.240 --> 33:32.920
Okay.

33:34.360 --> 33:35.040
How long will it take

33:35.040 --> 33:36.720
for Grandma's fracture to heal?

33:37.360 --> 33:39.400
Given her osteoporosis

33:39.480 --> 33:40.920
and partial paralysis,

33:40.920 --> 33:42.520
I'd say over six months.

33:44.080 --> 33:44.960
Six months?

33:45.240 --> 33:45.640
Okay.

33:46.120 --> 33:47.040
Thank you, Dr. Liu.

33:51.360 --> 33:52.520
Thanks, Han.

33:52.560 --> 33:53.520
Sorry for all the trouble.

33:53.920 --> 33:54.720
It's nothing.

33:55.520 --> 33:56.320
Don't blame yourself too much.

34:12.480 --> 34:14.560
Common rhetorical devices include

34:14.800 --> 34:15.440
metaphor,

34:15.920 --> 34:16.560
contrast,

34:16.880 --> 34:17.480
personification,

34:17.840 --> 34:18.440
and antithesis.

34:18.800 --> 34:19.320
Let's look at

34:19.320 --> 34:20.239
an example of antithesis.

34:21.560 --> 34:23.800
In parting we seek reunion,

34:24.480 --> 34:26.480
in failure we seek success,

34:26.960 --> 34:29.120
in sorrow we seek joy,

34:29.639 --> 34:31.800
in loss we seek what we once had.

34:32.840 --> 34:35.520
Hope is like a mast

34:36.120 --> 34:37.679
that holds up the sail of life.

34:38.360 --> 34:40.639
By setting parting against reunion,

34:40.880 --> 34:42.960
and failure against success,

34:43.400 --> 34:45.040
these balanced phrases echo one another

34:45.520 --> 34:46.719
in meaning

34:46.760 --> 34:47.719
and together express

34:47.920 --> 34:49.280
the longing for

34:49.480 --> 34:50.920
a better future after hardship.

34:54.239 --> 34:55.080
[Hope?]

34:56.760 --> 34:58.880
[When are we happiest?]

35:00.320 --> 35:02.640
[When our hearts are full of hope.]

35:04.320 --> 35:05.240
[When are we]

35:05.240 --> 35:06.480
[closest to despair?]

35:06.480 --> 35:06.960
Mom?

35:07.320 --> 35:07.800
Mom?

35:08.120 --> 35:08.400
Mom?

35:08.400 --> 35:08.880
[Perhaps]

35:09.760 --> 35:10.680
Mom? Mom, what's wrong?

35:10.680 --> 35:11.680
[when all that hope]

35:12.440 --> 35:13.000
Mom, are you okay? Mom?

35:13.000 --> 35:13.760
[suddenly falls apart.]

35:15.600 --> 35:17.160
[I once hoped that]

35:18.400 --> 35:20.520
[life could be as enduring]

35:21.760 --> 35:22.880
[as the earth.]

35:24.480 --> 35:25.640
[Only later did I learn that]

35:26.840 --> 35:28.000
[life is fragile,]

35:28.920 --> 35:30.120
[and fate is unpredictable.]

35:31.640 --> 35:32.840
[Hardship often]

35:34.240 --> 35:35.960
[strikes without warning.]

35:41.120 --> 35:42.720
You've been reported for uncertified

35:43.000 --> 35:44.000
eyebrow tattooing and injuring a customer.

35:44.520 --> 35:46.080
Please provide your credentials.

35:47.800 --> 35:48.600
We'll take the solutions

35:48.760 --> 35:49.640
from your salon back to the station

35:49.640 --> 35:50.240
for testing.

35:50.600 --> 35:51.880
If they don't meet safety standards,

35:52.080 --> 35:53.040
you'll be fined.

35:53.560 --> 35:54.600
In serious cases,

35:54.680 --> 35:56.440
your business license may be revoked.

35:57.040 --> 35:57.920
If you have no objections,

35:58.920 --> 35:59.520
please sign here.

36:01.800 --> 36:02.240
Let's go.

36:05.600 --> 36:06.960
Is she in trouble?

36:16.640 --> 36:17.520
Lanfang's salon...

36:19.760 --> 36:20.920
Is the salon shutting down?

36:21.080 --> 36:22.840
It's fine. We just need a few fixes.

36:23.440 --> 36:24.360
Once we're back open,

36:24.360 --> 36:25.240
please come again.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.320
Alright, nothing to see here.

36:26.600 --> 36:27.280
Okay.

36:27.800 --> 36:28.480
No big deal.

36:28.680 --> 36:29.440
See you again soon.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.000
[Plans falter,]

36:32.960 --> 36:34.080
[hope fades,]

36:35.280 --> 36:36.320
[that's just the way life is.]

36:55.320 --> 36:57.040
Excuse me, are you Zhou Guimei's family?

36:59.960 --> 37:00.400
Yes.

37:01.160 --> 37:02.360
This is your bill.

37:02.760 --> 37:03.760
You were admitted in a hurry last night

37:03.760 --> 37:04.600
and only paid the deposit.

37:04.680 --> 37:05.920
You need to pay the balance.

37:07.640 --> 37:08.680
How much is it?

37:09.600 --> 37:10.680
Is it expensive?

37:11.600 --> 37:11.880
Grandma...

37:11.880 --> 37:12.720
I told you I didn't want the surgery.

37:12.720 --> 37:14.080
you medical insurance can cover it.

37:15.000 --> 37:15.520
Don't worry.

37:24.880 --> 37:26.640
This can be covered, right?

37:27.440 --> 37:28.280
This is your balance

37:28.280 --> 37:29.320
after insurance.

37:31.320 --> 37:32.680
Okay, thank you.

37:54.920 --> 37:55.480
Hello? Mom?

37:57.240 --> 37:57.840
30,000 yuan?

37:58.400 --> 37:59.640
That's daylight robbery!

37:59.680 --> 38:01.600
30,000 yuan isn't nearly enough.

38:01.840 --> 38:02.720
Why don't you

38:02.720 --> 38:03.160
just

38:03.160 --> 38:04.600
take our lives?

38:05.400 --> 38:06.160
Officer,

38:06.520 --> 38:07.240
take a look.

38:07.240 --> 38:07.960
Look at my face.

38:08.640 --> 38:09.800
Officer, look.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.720
I have grounds for that.

38:12.000 --> 38:13.920
False advertising, ruined eyebrows.

38:14.040 --> 38:15.840
Medical bills plus emotional damages,

38:16.240 --> 38:17.400
30,000 is already a bargain.

38:17.520 --> 38:18.440
You want compensation?

38:18.440 --> 38:19.720
I should be asking foe one too!

38:19.840 --> 38:20.880
She trashed my shop.

38:21.240 --> 38:22.520
My mom fell and got hospitalized.

38:22.560 --> 38:23.680
She's still in hospital.

38:23.760 --> 38:24.280
Shouldn't you

38:24.280 --> 38:25.120
be paying me first?

38:25.120 --> 38:25.480
Wait.

38:25.560 --> 38:26.560
How is your mom

38:26.600 --> 38:27.600
falling my problem?

38:27.640 --> 38:28.320
Of course

38:28.400 --> 38:29.440
it's your problem!

38:29.480 --> 38:30.160
She wouldn't have fallen

38:30.160 --> 38:31.240
if it weren't for you!

38:31.280 --> 38:32.400
Don't mix the two.

38:32.600 --> 38:33.360
If you want me to pay,

38:33.440 --> 38:34.200
you pay me first.

38:34.240 --> 38:35.000
Ladies, ladies.

38:35.480 --> 38:37.040
This is a police station, not a marketplace.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.280
Sit down, please.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.280
Calm down. Calm down.

38:41.520 --> 38:43.040
Officer Xu,

38:43.160 --> 38:45.080
30,000 yuan is no small amount.

38:45.160 --> 38:47.040
She's asking for way too much.

38:47.240 --> 38:48.240
You hear that, officer?

38:48.440 --> 38:49.280
She won't pay up

38:49.280 --> 38:50.280
and now try to pin it on me.

38:50.320 --> 38:51.280
How am I pinning it on you?

38:51.280 --> 38:52.640
That's just the facts.

38:52.680 --> 38:53.520
- Look at my face!
- Today,

38:53.680 --> 38:55.240
we are here to mediate,

38:55.360 --> 38:56.400
not to argue.

38:56.840 --> 38:57.920
Everyone calm down, alright?

38:59.440 --> 39:00.000
Officer Xu.

39:00.400 --> 39:00.840
Wu.

39:01.880 --> 39:02.360
Wu?

39:04.680 --> 39:05.160
Officer Xu,

39:05.360 --> 39:06.440
can I talk to my mom in private?

39:06.720 --> 39:07.440
Sure, go ahead.

39:10.520 --> 39:11.160
Officer,

39:11.720 --> 39:12.400
look at my face.

39:12.640 --> 39:13.520
She destroyed my eyebrows.

39:13.760 --> 39:14.560
Is 30,000 yuan too much?

39:15.120 --> 39:15.880
I looked into it.

39:15.960 --> 39:17.520
30,000 yuan is way out of line.

39:17.920 --> 39:19.120
That's more than any court

39:19.120 --> 39:19.880
would ever order.

39:20.120 --> 39:21.400
Besides, she trashed the salon.

39:21.600 --> 39:23.160
She knows she has you,

39:23.440 --> 39:24.760
and she's inflating her claim.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.560
She's extorting us.

39:26.560 --> 39:27.120
Look,

39:27.440 --> 39:28.480
she agreed to let me

39:28.520 --> 39:29.880
practice on her at half price.

39:29.920 --> 39:31.440
And now she is acting like this.

39:32.560 --> 39:33.560
I can compensate her

39:33.760 --> 39:34.720
and apologize,

39:35.120 --> 39:36.600
but we can't let her

39:36.640 --> 39:37.800
take advantage of us, right?

39:39.440 --> 39:39.880
Well,

39:40.400 --> 39:41.640
I'll talk to her.

39:42.760 --> 39:44.320
We won't ask her to pay

39:44.320 --> 39:45.480
for the damage to the salon,

39:45.800 --> 39:47.120
but we only pay her medical bills.

39:51.320 --> 39:52.520
Since this is mediation,

39:52.840 --> 39:54.520
both sides need to agree on the terms.

39:55.040 --> 39:56.240
Talk it through

39:57.160 --> 39:58.240
and work out

39:58.240 --> 39:59.160
the amount between you.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.480
I want 30,000 yuan. That's final.

40:01.880 --> 40:03.520
And what's your response to

40:03.560 --> 40:04.440
the victim's demand?

40:04.760 --> 40:05.480
You hear that?

40:05.880 --> 40:07.320
I'm the victim here.

40:08.640 --> 40:09.480
You think I'm asking too much?

40:09.520 --> 40:11.080
I think I'm asking too little.

40:12.800 --> 40:13.400
Here's the thing.

40:13.880 --> 40:14.880
On the way here,

40:14.920 --> 40:16.040
I've looked into similar cases.

40:16.320 --> 40:17.160
My mom is at fault,

40:17.600 --> 40:18.120
and

40:18.400 --> 40:19.400
we will compensate you.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.120
But based on precedent,

40:21.560 --> 40:22.680
the amount won't be this high.

40:23.520 --> 40:24.240
Besides,

40:24.240 --> 40:25.600
you smashed up our salon,

40:25.840 --> 40:26.480
and my grandma

40:26.480 --> 40:27.360
is still in the hospital.

40:28.080 --> 40:28.960
Given that you're Mr. Zhu's

40:29.000 --> 40:29.960
ex-wife,

40:30.440 --> 40:31.800
I won't ask you for compensation.

40:32.720 --> 40:33.560
Don't quote

40:33.560 --> 40:34.360
cases at me.

40:34.560 --> 40:36.040
And don't bring up Zhu Feng.

40:36.240 --> 40:37.400
Take a good look at these.

40:37.600 --> 40:38.600
I'm not

40:38.800 --> 40:39.840
like anyone else.

40:53.000 --> 40:54.120
Your skin reaction

40:54.120 --> 40:55.440
may not have been caused by us.

40:56.280 --> 40:56.920
But don't worry.

40:57.480 --> 40:58.440
We will cover your

40:58.440 --> 40:59.360
dermatology bills.

41:00.480 --> 41:00.960
1,500 yuan.

41:01.520 --> 41:02.680
How is that enough?

41:03.280 --> 41:04.880
What about my emotional distress?

41:05.720 --> 41:07.000
I just got divorced.

41:07.160 --> 41:08.240
Now my face looks like this

41:08.400 --> 41:09.520
because of these botched eyebrows.

41:10.160 --> 41:10.880
I didn't even go to

41:10.880 --> 41:11.760
the blind date I'd arranged.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.240
If I miss out on a good match,

41:13.360 --> 41:14.920
how can you make up for that?

41:15.520 --> 41:15.960
How about this?

41:16.880 --> 41:17.920
We'll add another 3,000 yuan

41:18.240 --> 41:20.120
for lost income and emotional distress.

41:22.680 --> 41:23.920
Now I see.

41:24.040 --> 41:24.720
Li Lanfang,

41:25.080 --> 41:26.440
you brought your son here

41:26.640 --> 41:27.160
because you

41:27.160 --> 41:28.480
never intended to settle this.

41:28.640 --> 41:29.520
Medical costs

41:29.520 --> 41:30.480
plus 3,00 yuan

41:30.640 --> 41:32.240
is actually a reasonable settlement

41:32.240 --> 41:32.920
in civil cases like this.

41:32.920 --> 41:33.480
I don't accept it.

41:33.960 --> 41:34.720
Li Lanfang,

41:34.800 --> 41:35.760
I'll see you in court.

41:35.800 --> 41:36.720
Forget mediation.

41:36.880 --> 41:37.840
If you don't pay me,

41:38.000 --> 41:39.400
don't think about reopening your salon.

41:40.800 --> 41:41.480
He Xiaolian!

41:43.040 --> 41:43.440
Well,

41:43.840 --> 41:44.480
Officer Xu,

41:45.000 --> 41:46.080
what do we do now that she's left?

41:46.600 --> 41:47.280
If mediation fails,

41:47.440 --> 41:48.360
it goes to legal proceedings.

41:48.680 --> 41:49.320
No way.

41:49.560 --> 41:50.560
It takes too much time and effort.

41:50.680 --> 41:51.240
It's not worth it.

41:52.240 --> 41:53.000
Li Lanfang,

41:53.640 --> 41:54.680
I have to be straight with you.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.040
You offered eyebrow tattooing services

41:56.040 --> 41:56.920
without the certification,

41:56.920 --> 41:57.680
and things went wrong.

41:57.920 --> 41:59.280
That's an objective fact,

41:59.600 --> 42:00.840
and it'll work against you in court.

42:02.040 --> 42:02.480
Alright.

42:03.560 --> 42:05.080
Mediation is the better way to go.

42:06.880 --> 42:07.880
We have to talk to her again?

42:08.880 --> 42:09.920
If you

42:09.920 --> 42:10.680
disagree on

42:10.680 --> 42:11.400
the compensation amount,

42:11.640 --> 42:12.840
you can request a second mediation session.

42:13.360 --> 42:14.440
But Xuan Island must

42:14.800 --> 42:15.800
suspend operations.

42:16.040 --> 42:16.640
You can only reopen

42:16.920 --> 42:17.840
once you have the qualifications.

42:18.520 --> 42:18.920
Got it.

42:35.520 --> 42:37.320
Getting certified is such a hassle.

42:39.040 --> 42:40.800
She's got some nerve.

42:42.200 --> 42:43.040
I haven't even gone after her

42:43.080 --> 42:44.600
for what happened to Grandma,

42:44.720 --> 42:45.400
and she

42:45.720 --> 42:46.880
wants 30,000 yuan from us?

42:46.920 --> 42:48.240
What eyebrows are worth 30,000 yuan?

42:49.880 --> 42:50.680
I was supposed to

42:50.720 --> 42:52.160
go to the hospital first thing this morning,

42:52.560 --> 42:53.280
Instead, I got called

42:53.280 --> 42:54.440
to the police station

42:54.480 --> 42:55.680
and stuck there all day.

42:56.560 --> 42:57.280
It's my fault.

42:57.880 --> 42:59.440
Why did I do her eyebrows?

43:00.720 --> 43:01.760
What was I even thinking?

43:01.840 --> 43:02.520
Why did I do it?

43:02.720 --> 43:03.560
Why?

43:03.600 --> 43:04.520
Stupid! Stupid!

43:04.720 --> 43:06.080
It's my fault, my fault.

43:06.080 --> 43:06.760
All my fault.

43:06.920 --> 43:07.920
None of this would've happened otherwise.

43:08.040 --> 43:08.880
None of it.

43:09.240 --> 43:10.040
Just listen to music.

43:10.840 --> 43:11.560
Give it a rest.

43:15.480 --> 43:16.160
What strange songs

43:16.160 --> 43:16.920
are you young people

43:16.920 --> 43:18.240
listening to these days?

43:21.520 --> 43:22.400
It's not bad.

43:24.320 --> 43:24.960
Let me turn it up for you.
